      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/St._Louis_Park%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Pavek Museum of Broadcasting, home to a major collection of antique radio and television gear, sits in St. Louis Park.",
